OL,3,ALiberia agrees to accept 1,200 foreign
OL,4,Adeportees from the US
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberia has agreed to accept up to
OL,7,F1,200 foreigners deported from the US
OL,8,Fover the next year in one of the
OL,9,Fbiggest deals agreed so far by
OL,10,FWashington as it continues its
OL,11,Fclampdown on illegal migration.
OL,13,FSuch agreements with other countries
OL,14,Fhave often involved people who are
OL,15,Flegally protected from returning to
OL,16,Ftheir own countries, for reasons such
OL,17,Fas persecution. It is not clear if
OL,18,Fthose coming to Liberia have protection
OL,19,Forders.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
