OL,3,ALiberia agrees to accept 1,200 foreign
OL,4,Adeportees from the US
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The government wants to emphasise that
OL,7,Fthose being brought to Liberia are
OL,8,Fbeing received as guests," Information
OL,9,FMinister Jerolinmek Piah said.
OL,11,FAn initial group of 20 are due to land
OL,12,Fon Thursday and would be free to go
OL,13,Fwhen they wished or could apply for
OL,14,Fasylum, he said.
